---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Query Received]) --> CacheCheck{Semantic Cache<br/>Hit?}
    CacheCheck -->|Yes, Above Threshold| CacheHit["📦 Return Cached Answer"]
    CacheHit --> EndCached("✓ END: Cached"):::terminalCached
    
    CacheCheck -->|No| HybridRetrieval["Hybrid Retrieval<br/>(pgvector HNSW + Keyword)"]:::processing
    HybridRetrieval --> WriteTrace1["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace1 --> RelevanceGrader{Relevance Grader<br/>Local Ollama}
    
    RelevanceGrader -->|PASS| Generation["Cost-Aware Router<br/>(Ollama → Cloud → Gemini → OpenAI)"]:::processing
    Generation --> WriteTrace2["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace2 --> GroundednessGrader{Groundedness Grader<br/>vs Evidence}
    
    GroundednessGrader -->|PASS| ReturnAnswer["✓ Return Answer<br/>with Citations"]:::processing
    ReturnAnswer --> EndAnswered("✓ END: Answered"):::terminalAnswered
    
    RelevanceGrader -->|FAIL| QueryRewrite{"Max Retries<br/>Exceeded?"}
    QueryRewrite -->|No| Rewrite["Query Rewrite Node"]:::processing
    Rewrite --> WriteTrace3["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace3 -->|Loop Back to Retrieval| HybridRetrieval
    
    QueryRewrite -->|Yes, 2 Attempts| WebSearch["Web Search MCP<br/>Fallback"]:::processing
    WebSearch --> WriteTrace4["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace4 -->|Re-evaluate| RelevanceGrader
    
    GroundednessGrader -->|FAIL| GroundednessRetry{"Max Retries<br/>Exceeded?"}
    GroundednessRetry -->|No| Regenerate["Regenerate<br/>+ Stricter Constraints<br/>+ Escalate Tier"]:::processing
    Regenerate --> WriteTrace5["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace5 --> GroundednessGrader
    
    GroundednessRetry -->|Yes, 2 Attempts| Refusal["❌ Insufficient Evidence<br/>Refusal"]:::processing
    Refusal --> WriteTrace6["📝 Write Trace & Checkpoint"]:::sideeffect
    WriteTrace6 --> EndRefused("✗ END: Refused"):::terminalRefused
    
    classDef terminalCached fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#4ade80,stroke-width:3px,font-weight:bold
    classDef terminalAnswered fill:#ecfeff,stroke:#22d3ee,stroke-width:3px,font-weight:bold
    classDef terminalRefused fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#f87171,stroke-width:3px,font-weight:bold
    classDef processing fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#818cf8,stroke-width:2px
    classDef sideeffect fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:1px,font-style:italic